#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Owly Drop makes AirDrop between iPhones and Linux a matter of flipping a "
"switch: become visible, accept what an iPhone sends, or drop files on the "
"window to send them back."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.Simon_du06.OwlyDrop.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"It is a graphical front end for Owly, which runs Apple's AWDL Wi-Fi link and "
"the AirDrop protocol on ordinary Wi-Fi cards. Owly must be installed and "
"working with your Wi-Fi card."
msgstr ""

